[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526194392","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2526194392","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100168","id":2526194392,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WkqrY","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21325943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry","html_url":"https://github.com/markdibarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T15:58:45Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T15:58:45Z","body":"Is this a regression? What version was it last working in?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526194392/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526200049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2526200049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100168","id":2526200049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WksDx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T16:07:25Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T16:07:25Z","body":"Not a bug, see:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94630","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526200049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526212791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2526212791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100168","id":2526212791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WkvK3","user":{"login":"DarkiStar","id":23613040,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNjEzMDQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23613040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkiStar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkiStar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T16:41:57Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T16:41:57Z","body":"Am I the only one who finds this pretty weird?\n\n```\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar rtl : RichTextLabel = RichTextLabel.new()\n\t\n\trtl.text = 'Hello World'\n\trtl.add_text('I want to add this text but it does not work!')\n\t\n\trtl.text += '-add more-'\n\t\n\tprints('rtl.text', rtl.text)\n\tprints('rtl.get_parsed_text()', rtl.get_parsed_text())\n\noutput:\n\nrtl.text: Hello World-add more-\nrtl.get_parsed_text(): Hello World-add more-\n\n```\n\nwith the following line commented out:\n\nrtl.text += '-add more-'\n\nit changes the output in an unexpected way.\n\n```\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar rtl : RichTextLabel = RichTextLabel.new()\n\t\n\trtl.text = 'Hello World'\n\trtl.add_text('I want to add this text but it does not work!')\n\t\n\t#rtl.text += '-add more-' # this line is now commented out\n\t\n\tprints('rtl.text:', rtl.text)\n\tprints('rtl.get_parsed_text():', rtl.get_parsed_text())\n\noutput:\n\nrtl.text: Hello World\nrtl.get_parsed_text(): Hello WorldI want to add this text but it does not work!\n```\n\nIf the behavior is intentional, I can live with it just fine. I just think it's not really intuitive, and many people will likely have trouble with it.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526212791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526357580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2526357580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100168","id":2526357580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WlShM","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21325943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry","html_url":"https://github.com/markdibarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T20:03:47Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T20:03:47Z","body":"It is intentional, but may be worth revisiting to figure out better names and workflow for Godot 5.0. For now it works like this IIRC:\nWhat RTL displays is the tag stack rendered with formatting, regardless of whether it was formed through setting `text` or a series of `push_` or `add_` methods.\nSetting `text` clears the tag stack and creates a new one, parsing the string you set.\nGetting `text` just gives you the string you previously set. It doesn't try to form a new one from parsing the stack, and would be pretty inefficient if so.\nAdding to `text` still clears and recreates the tag stack, but it just does so adding to the string you previously set.\n\nSo what you were doing in your example is:\n\n- Stored the string `Hello World`, RTL cleared the tag stack, parsed the string into tags, and displayed it.\n- Added `I want to add this text but it does not work!` to the tag stack, but not to `text`.\n- Added `-add more-` to the string `Hello World` stored in `text`, cleared the tag stack, parsed this new string into tags and displayed it.\n\nA follow up question might be \"why is `text` a property then and not separate and more descriptive get and set methods?\" and I imagine the answer is that you wouldn't be able to set it in the inspector then. It's just a nice shortcut for if you're not using RTL purely through code.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526357580/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533505710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2533505710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100168","id":2533505710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XAjqu","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T02:48:15Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T02:48:15Z","body":"I think `push_*()` or `add_*()` can print a warning if `text` is not empty.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533505710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]